  "summary": "Traditional Sami craft of working with reindeer leather to create functional and decorative items with distinctive patterns and techniques.",
  "description": "Characterized by soft, durable reindeer leather decorated with geometric patterns, cutwork, and sometimes pewter thread embroidery, this craft produces items from clothing to containers. Developed through centuries of nomadic reindeer herding, the leatherwork reflects both practical needs for weather-resistant materials and cultural symbolism through decorative patterns.",
